│ "title": "Perinatal interventions and survival in resource‐poor settings: which work, which don\'t, which have the   │
│ jury out?", "abstract": "Perinatal conditions make the largest contribution to the burden of disease in low-income   │
│ countries. Although postneonatal mortality rates have declined, stillbirth and early neonatal mortality rates remain │
